REFERENCE           TESSELLATION
LANG_ENGLISH        "Tessellation"

REFERENCE           MATERIALS_WITH_A_HEIGHT_IN_THEIR_BUM
LANG_ENGLISH        "Materials with a height in their bump map get real bumps: the graphics card cuts their surfaces finer and lifts them. Off: they look carved by parallax instead, which costs less. Needs a graphics card with tessellation."

