REFERENCE           A_SABER_KILL_CUTS_THE_BODY_THROUGH_A
LANG_ENGLISH        "A saber kill cuts the body through along the swing, with a burnt, glowing cut. A body that lies on the ground can be cut again by a swing through it: several times, once, or not at all. Needs the Vulkan renderer."

